{
    "title": "\u0426\u0438\u0430\u043d. \u041d\u0435\u0434\u0432\u0438\u0436\u0438\u043c\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c, \u043a\u0432\u0430\u0440\u0442\u0438\u0440\u044b",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfe2\ud83d\udd0d Cyan is the leading service in Russia for those looking for real estate for rent or purchase, including the opportunity to rent an apartment daily or find long-term apartment rentals. Here you can easily find advertisements for the sale and rental of apartments, houses, and commercial real estate. Our service offers a wide selection of apartments in new buildings and secondary housing, including unique apartment designs and detailed apartment layouts. For those wishing to buy an apartment or calculate a mortgage, Cian provides all the necessary tools for assessing the value of real estate. Each listing is reviewed by our team of moderators to ensure listings are current and reliable.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe0\ud83d\udd11 New buildings. In Qian you will find a wide selection of apartments in new buildings. Just set the search parameters: completion date of the residential complex, floor, area, presence or absence of finishing, as well as the price for the entire apartment or per square meter. If you prefer to buy from developers or the roominess of your apartment is important to you, special filters are available for you. This way, you can easily find your ideal residential complex.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe6\ud83d\udcc8 Mortgage. Fill out one form, send it to 7 banks, receive personal offers in just 2 minutes and the mortgage is yours! Compare conditions and choose the best offer that suits you. A mortgage opens the door to your future: start achieving your dream today and receive mortgage offers to choose the ideal house or apartment. A mortgage is your key to your own home or apartment.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f\ud83c\udfe1 Buying or renting apartments and houses. Choose apartments and houses for purchase or rent using the map in the application. Just highlight the area you are interested in and all available advertisements will appear in front of you. The search is simplified thanks to detailed information about the listings, including characteristics of the house, area and available infrastructure - from schools and kindergartens to shops. Save your search or add listings to your favorites to receive notifications about new listings in your desired home or area. You will always be aware of current advertisements, whether for purchase, mortgage or for daily rent.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe2\ud83d\udcca Commercial real estate. Rent or buy commercial real estate to suit all your business needs, including offices, warehouses, and retail space. Use the convenient filters in the application to get advertisements based on key parameters and quickly find what is ideal for your business. Our service simplifies the search for commercial real estate, providing access to a wide range of offers to suit a variety of requirements and budgets.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd11\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0fDaily rental. We have a convenient search for apartments, rooms, houses, cottages and rooms for daily rent. See options by map or list, use filters by prices, areas, housing types and amenities. This will help you compare several objects and choose the best one. Any location is available to choose from: in the city center, near the metro, near the sea or a famous landmark.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce2\ud83d\udd11 Renting or selling real estate. Post advertisements for rent or sale of any type of real estate. In their personal account, users will find all the necessary tools, be it to interact with potential tenants or buyers through calls and chat. We also offer support from our agents who can help resolve any issues related to the real estate market, ensuring a smooth buying, selling or renting process.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcca Real estate valuation. Find out the market price of your apartment, house or any other real estate quickly and free of charge. Get information about the cadastral value and current rental rates. Look at the history of advertisements for the property you are interested in to assess the dynamics of prices and demand in the market. This is a key tool for those seeking to maximize their investment in real estate or determine the optimal value for their property. Make an informed choice when selling, buying or renting!\r\n\r\n \ud83d\udd0dLook for Cyan first!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udfe2\ud83d\udd0d Cyan is the leading service in Russia for those looking for real estate for rent or purchase, including the opportunity to rent an apartment daily or find long-term apartment rentals. Here you can easily find advertisements for the sale and rental of apartments, houses, and commercial real estate. Our service offers a wide selection of apartments in new buildings and secondary housing, including unique apartment designs and detailed apartment layouts. For those wishing to buy an apartment or calculate a mortgage, Cian provides all the necessary tools for assessing the value of real estate. Each listing is reviewed by our team of moderators to ensure listings are current and reliable.<br><br>\ud83c\udfe0\ud83d\udd11 New buildings. In Qian you will find a wide selection of apartments in new buildings. Just set the search parameters: completion date of the residential complex, floor, area, presence or absence of finishing, as well as the price for the entire apartment or per square meter. If you prefer to buy from developers or the roominess of your apartment is important to you, special filters are available for you. This way, you can easily find your ideal residential complex.<br><br>\ud83c\udfe6\ud83d\udcc8 Mortgage. Fill out one form, send it to 7 banks, receive personal offers in just 2 minutes and the mortgage is yours! Compare conditions and choose the best offer that suits you. A mortgage opens the door to your future: start achieving your dream today and receive mortgage offers to choose the ideal house or apartment. A mortgage is your key to your own home or apartment.<br><br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f\ud83c\udfe1 Buying or renting apartments and houses. Choose apartments and houses for purchase or rent using the map in the application. Just highlight the area you are interested in and all available advertisements will appear in front of you. The search is simplified thanks to detailed information about the listings, including characteristics of the house, area and available infrastructure - from schools and kindergartens to shops. Save your search or add listings to your favorites to receive notifications about new listings in your desired home or area. You will always be aware of current advertisements, whether for purchase, mortgage or for daily rent.<br><br>\ud83c\udfe2\ud83d\udcca Commercial real estate. Rent or buy commercial real estate to suit all your business needs, including offices, warehouses, and retail space. Use the convenient filters in the application to get advertisements based on key parameters and quickly find what is ideal for your business. Our service simplifies the search for commercial real estate, providing access to a wide range of offers to suit a variety of requirements and budgets.<br><br>\ud83d\udd11\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0fDaily rental. We have a convenient search for apartments, rooms, houses, cottages and rooms for daily rent. See options by map or list, use filters by prices, areas, housing types and amenities. This will help you compare several objects and choose the best one. Any location is available to choose from: in the city center, near the metro, near the sea or a famous landmark.<br><br>\ud83d\udce2\ud83d\udd11 Renting or selling real estate. Post advertisements for rent or sale of any type of real estate. In their personal account, users will find all the necessary tools, be it to interact with potential tenants or buyers through calls and chat. We also offer support from our agents who can help resolve any issues related to the real estate market, ensuring a smooth buying, selling or renting process.<br><br>\ud83d\udcb0\ud83d\udcca Real estate valuation. Find out the market price of your apartment, house or any other real estate quickly and free of charge. Get information about the cadastral value and current rental rates. Look at the history of advertisements for the property you are interested in to assess the dynamics of prices and demand in the market. This is a key tool for those seeking to maximize their investment in real estate or determine the optimal value for their property. Make an informed choice when selling, buying or renting!<br><br> \ud83d\udd0dLook for Cyan first!",
